      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "In Taiwan, as the 2019 Hong Kong protests erupt across the strait, Zhong-Han, a young silent thug, leads a life divided between his work in a family restaurant and parties in the dark Taipei underworld. But when a questionable businessman wants to buy the restaurant, Zhong-Han is drawn into a whirlwind of events that confronts him with the corrupt power games of his country.",
          "runtime": 120,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Locust"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "2019 年的台灣適逢燥熱大選，一場抗爭也在香港發生。小人物的生活還在繼續，失語年輕人鍾翰在台北親戚家的傳統小吃店寄人籬下，雖被真心相待，卻難解內心虛渺。他在每個暗夜投奔幫派，縱情舞池，既在超商邂逅戀曲，卻也一步步陷入政商黑土地權謀的腥風血雨，直至終於無法抽身。台裔編導王凱民聯合多國合製，對照政治動盪與常民日常，捕捉緊繃氛圍下的台北暗流。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "在失語青春死亡之前 讓我奮力一擊",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://tandemfilms.fr/film/gangsoftaiwan",
          "overview": "À Taïwan, Zhong-Han, un jeune homme mutique d'une vingtaine d'années, mène une double vie. Employé dans un restaurant familial le jour, il rackette en bande la nuit pour le compte de parrains locaux. Mais le rachat du restaurant par un homme d'affaires véreux met en danger ses proches, et oblige Zhong-Han à affronter son propre gang.",
          "runtime": 135,
          "tagline": "Un pays au bord du chaos. Des citoyens corrompus. Des gangs impitoyables.",
          "title": "Gangs of Taïwan"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Zhong-Han trabalha em um restaurante durante o dia e convive com criminosos durante a noite. Mas a mudança de direção do restaurante resulta em uma inesperada reação em cadeia que obrigará Zhong-Han a enfrentar a corrupção de seu país.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Gafanhoto"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PL",
        "iso_639_1": "pl",
        "name": "Polski",
        "english_name": "Polish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Na Tajwanie, gdy w 2019 roku po drugiej stronie cieśniny wybuchają protesty w Hongkongu, Zhong-Han, młody, cichy bandyta, wiedzie życie podzielone między pracę w rodzinnej restauracji a imprezy w mrocznym półświatku Tajpej. Jednak gdy podejrzany biznesmen chce kupić restaurację, Zhong-Han zostaje wciągnięty w wir wydarzeń, które konfrontują go ze skorumpowanymi rozgrywkami o władzę w jego kraju.",
          "runtime": 128,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Szarańcza"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "HK",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
